 -- Flant <aleksandr.stefurishin@flant.com>  Tue, 23 Jun 2026 22:43:10 +0300

drbd (9.2.19~flant.3-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix drbdsetup down/del-peer/del-connection hang scenarios
  * Fix receiver thread restart race and connect loop exit
  * Fix double fput kernel BUG in link_backing_dev error path
  * Fix bitmap IO deadlock when IO suspended due to quorum loss
  * Do not force-secondary on transient handshake retry
  * Fix transport listener race causing rejected connections
  * Fix resync-again on in-flight acks (do_remote guard + oos==0 skip)
  * Fix stable source detection (require L_ESTABLISHED for Primary)
  * Fix resync stall: clean up stale intervals on disconnect
  * Fix unstable resync: re-handshake instead of UUID rotation

 -- Flant <david.magton@flant.com>  Tue, 23 Jun 2026 12:02:00 +0000

